[namespace.udecl]/2 + [class.inhctor.init]: an inherited base default
constructor makes the derived class default-constructible (also when defaulted
move members suppress the implicit default constructor), and the class's own
default constructor takes precedence.  Cross-checked against g++ and clang++.
